---
import PolicyLayout from "../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro";
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Accessibility Statement | ATL TV Mount"
  description="Accessibility Statement for ATL TV Mount, operated by Northline Mounting Services LLC."
>
  <p class="policy-kicker">Legal</p>
  <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
  <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: September 22, 2026</p>

  <div class="policy-content">
    <p>
      <strong>ATL TV Mount, operated by Northline Mounting Services LLC</strong>
      is committed to making our website reasonably accessible and usable for as many people as possible.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Approach</h2>

    <p>
      We aim to design and maintain our website with accessibility in mind, including clear navigation,
      readable text, sufficient contrast, keyboard-accessible controls where practical, and meaningful
      structure for common website content.
    </p>

    <p>
      We continue to review and improve the website as content, features, and technology change.
    </p>

    <h2>Accessibility Is an Ongoing Process</h2>

    <p>
      Accessibility can depend on many factors, including browsers, devices, assistive technologies,
      third-party integrations, and the way individual features are implemented.
    </p>

    <p>
      Because our website and services evolve over time, some areas may not always work perfectly
      with every assistive technology or configuration.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      Some website features may rely on third-party platforms or embedded services.
      We may not control the accessibility of those third-party interfaces, but we aim to choose
      and configure services in a way that supports a usable customer experience.
    </p>

    <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>

    <p>
      If you have difficulty accessing information, using a website feature, requesting an estimate,
      or booking a service, please contact us.
    </p>

    <p>
      We will make reasonable efforts to provide the information or service through an alternative
      method when appropriate.
    </p>

    <p>
      Phone: <a href="tel:+14704709331">(470) 470-9331</a><br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:info@atltvmount.com">info@atltvmount.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Feedback</h2>

    <p>
      If you encounter an accessibility problem on our website, please let us know what page or feature
      caused the issue and, if helpful, what browser, device, or assistive technology you were using.
    </p>

    <p>
      This information can help us identify and address the problem more effectively.
    </p>

    <h2>Related Policies</h2>

    <ul>
